@startuml
' Source (synthetic brief): A customer asks the counter for an out-of-print title.
' Staff search the order system, which finds it out of stock. Staff place a special
' order with the distributor, who replies with a 10-day ETA. Staff take a 20% deposit;
' the same day the order system saves the order and emails a confirmation. When the
' book arrives, staff send a pickup notice.
' Not stated: what happens to the deposit if the customer cancels.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
skinparam wrapWidth 300
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam legendBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam legendBorderColor $LEGEND_FRAME
hide stereotype
hide circle
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
rectangle { RoundCorner 14 }
.failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
.group1 { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
.group2 { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
.group3 { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
.group4 { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
</style>
' Numbered steps (optional, STYLE rule 16): $step(1) prints a blue badge in a label, an edge label
' or a legend table row. Knob STEP_BADGE: the badge colour.
!$STEP_BADGE = "#1565C0"
!function $step($n)
!return "<back:" + $STEP_BADGE + "><color:#FFFFFF><b> " + $n + " </b></color></back>"
!endfunction
' house-preamble-end

title Special order for an out-of-print book (sequence)
autonumber "<b>[00]"

actor "Customer" as customer
box "Shop"
  participant "Counter staff" as staff
  participant "Order system" as system
  database "Orders DB" as db
end box
box "Outside services"
  participant "Distributor" as distributor
  participant "Email service" as email
end box

customer -> staff : asks for the title
staff -> system : search catalogue
system -> db : look up ISBN
db --> system : out of stock
staff -> distributor : place special order
distributor --> staff : ETA 10 days
staff -> customer : take 20% deposit
note right of customer
  not stated: deposit refund
  if the customer cancels
end note
group same day
  system -> db : save order and deposit
  system -> email : send confirmation
end
== about 10 days later ==
distributor -> staff : book arrives
staff -> email : send pickup notice

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | solid arrow | request or action |
  | dashed arrow | reply |
  | cylinder | data store |
  | box | lane: shop or outside |
  | "not stated" note | source gap |
endlegend
@enduml
